{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-basketball-for-kids-write-like-you-are-talking-to-explain-clearly-commo/audio/main-aae3760bff95.mp3","durationSec":126.456,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.36,"text":"Basketball for kids is a team game with a ball and a hoop."},{"start":3.36,"end":5.72,"text":"Basketball is a team sport."},{"start":6.34,"end":7.1,"text":"Two teams play."},{"start":7.68,"end":9.68,"text":"Each team has five players on the court."},{"start":10.26,"end":11.68,"text":"The court is the place where they play."},{"start":12.26,"end":13.26,"text":"The players use a ball."},{"start":13.7,"end":15.36,"text":"They try to shoot the ball through a hoop."},{"start":15.96,"end":17.86,"text":"The hoop is a basket on a backboard."},{"start":18.4,"end":20.58,"text":"The backboard is the board behind the basket."},{"start":21.18,"end":23.16,"text":"A made shot can give a team points."},{"start":23.74,"end":26.06,"text":"A field goal is usually worth two points."},{"start":26.68,"end":29.22,"text":"A shot from behind the three-point line is different."},{"start":29.73,"end":32.06,"text":"It is worth three points when it goes through the hoop."},{"start":32.76,"end":37.62,"text":"The three-point line is the line on the court where a made shot is worth three points."},{"start":37.62,"end":40.98,"text":"Basketball began with a gym teacher."},{"start":40.98,"end":45.56,"text":"James Naismith was the gym teacher who made basketball in 1891."},{"start":46.32,"end":49.08,"text":"The first game was played on December 21 that year."},{"start":49.46,"end":51.38,"text":"It happened in Springfield, Massachusetts."},{"start":52.1,"end":55.42,"text":"Springfield is the city in Massachusetts where basketball was first played."},{"start":56.06,"end":59.06,"text":"Basketball has a clear starting year, day, and place."},{"start":59.94,"end":63.18,"text":"One big name in basketball is the National Basketball Association."},{"start":63.96,"end":65.74,"text":"It is a big basketball league."},{"start":66.66,"end":68.52,"text":"People often use the short name NBA."},{"start":69.26,"end":71.56,"text":"NBA means the National Basketball Association."},{"start":72.28,"end":76.5,"text":"When you see NBA, you now know that it names the big basketball league."},{"start":77.14,"end":80.26,"text":"This short name is also important in the story of a famous player."},{"start":81.1,"end":83.36,"text":"Michael Jordan is a famous basketball player."},{"start":83.73,"end":86.08,"text":"His full name is Michael Jeffrey Jordan."},{"start":87.04,"end":89.58,"text":"He was born on February 17, 1963."},{"start":90.54,"end":91.8,"text":"People also call him MJ."},{"start":92.36,"end":93.72,"text":"MJ is made from his initials."},{"start":94.4,"end":98.74,"text":"He played 15 seasons in the NBA between 1984 and 2003."},{"start":99.52,"end":101.04,"text":"People also gave him other nicknames."},{"start":101.86,"end":104.56,"text":"He won six NBA championships with the Chicago Bulls."},{"start":105.16,"end":110.2,"text":"The Chicago Bulls are the basketball team he played for when he won those championships."},{"start":111.02,"end":116.54,"text":"In the 1995–96 season, the team had 72 regular-season wins."},{"start":117.28,"end":118.62,"text":"This was a record at that time."},{"start":119.46,"end":121.28,"text":"People called him Air Jordan."},{"start":121.78,"end":123.68,"text":"They also called him His Airness."},{"start":124.44,"end":126.1,"text":"Both names were nicknames for him."}],"words":[{"text":"Basketball","start":0,"end":0.4},{"text":"for","start":0.4,"end":0.6},{"text":"kids","start":0.6,"end":0.86},{"text":"is","start":0.86,"end":1.14},{"text":"a","start":1.14,"end":1.32},{"text":"team","start":1.32,"end":1.54},{"text":"game","start":1.54,"end":1.88},{"text":"with","start":1.88,"end":2.22},{"text":"a","start":2.22,"end":2.36},{"text":"ball","start":2.36,"end":2.66},{"text":"and","start":2.66,"end":3.06},